age": "ADD-03"}, "statements": [{"evidence": [{"doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "span", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:AppA/para1", "words": "Table 5-1 is reproduced below as issued by the Northern Region Airspace Safeguarding Office."}], "id": "F1", "kind": "fact", "text": "Appendix A of ADD-03 reproduces Table 5-1 as issued by the Northern Region Airspace Safeguarding Office; the image on page 4 is that office's letter."}, {"evidence": [{"crop_sha256": "55b215de1ef0b4e60eb4ff4c0956e056ddcf617909533d124df917c06e845111", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/hdr-en", "words": "Northern Region Airspace Safeguarding Office"}, {"crop_sha256": "085fee9b38a86ab0627eaaf03d4b4688b3462b1fc1f70838c4516a7b05239b84", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/hdr-ar", "words": "مكتب حماية المجال الجوي بالمنطقة الشمالية"}], "id": "F2", "kind": "fact", "text": "The image's letterhead names the issuing office in English and Arabic."}, {"evidence": [{"crop_sha256": "611b9b7d4091da1d66770ea4b93355d345c3a1357acf8f24d9a3028e4bcb3fb2", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/date", "words": "التاريخ: ١٠ نوفمبر ٢٠٢٦م"}, {"crop_sha256": "36f0bc6f100e664d3d517c42ac951f889ef31a2991983d383036dbe61033a3a8", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/ref", "words": "الرقم: ٤٧١/٢٠٢٦"}, {"crop_sha256": "53c8cf8bb00428ec168e4cf0413857cac8422edd7464b54ba73d2e332e88b887", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/subject", "words": "الموضوع: اشتراطات الارتفاعات لموقع محطة معالجة مياه الصرف الصحي المستقلة بوادي السرحان"}, {"crop_sha256": "e5f0adb3b0e582475eef3dcd78e3716cf9ebfc4db2d03bb28bd5d1786689a381", "doc": "ADD-03", "kind": "reading", "page": 4, "unit_id": "ADD-03:p4-image/tender-ref", "words": "مناقصة رقم: NUPA/ISTP/2026/014"}], "id": "F3", "kind": "fact", "text": "The image prints a date line, a reference number, a subject line and a